- in loop(): `int brut = analogRead(32);` (0 to 4095), printed to the serial monitor;
- if `brut > 2300` (dry soil): `digitalWrite(4, LOW)`, the pump runs; otherwise `HIGH`, it stops;
- `delay(500);` between two readings.
